<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>KeySuite Alpha</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="assets/keylargo-logo.png" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/xlsx@0.18.5/dist/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div id="toast" class="toast"></div>

  <section id="loginView" class="login-shell">
    <div class="login-card">
      <img src="assets/keylargo-logo.png" alt="Keylargo" class="login-logo" />
      <h1>KeySuite</h1>
      <p>Sales and product management alpha</p>
      <label>Email</label>
      <input id="loginEmail" type="email" value="ray@keylargo.com" />
      <label>Password</label>
      <input id="loginPassword" type="password" value="admin123" />
      <button class="primary full" onclick="login()">Log in</button>
      <small>Demo admin: ray@keylargo.com / admin123</small>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="appView" class="app hidden">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="brand">
        <img src="assets/keylargo-logo.png" alt="Keylargo" />
        <div><strong>KeySuite</strong><span>Alpha V0.1</span></div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <button class="nav active" data-page="dashboard" onclick="showPage('dashboard', this)">Dashboard</button>
        <button class="nav" data-page="users" onclick="showPage('users', this)">Users</button>
        <button class="nav" data-page="customers" onclick="showPage('customers', this)">Customers</button>
        <button class="nav" data-page="products" onclick="showPage('products', this)">Products</button>
        <button class="nav" data-page="price-import" onclick="showPage('price-import', this)">Excel Price Import</button>
      </nav>
      <div class="sidebar-bottom">
        <div id="currentUserLabel"></div>
        <button class="ghost full" onclick="logout()">Log out</button>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main>
      <header class="topbar">
        <div>
          <h2 id="pageTitle">Dashboard</h2>
          <p id="pageSubtitle">Your KeySuite working demo</p>
        </div>
        <button class="primary" onclick="quickAdd()">+ Quick Add</button>
      </header>

      <section id="page-dashboard" class="page active-page">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">KEYSUITE ALPHA</span>
            <h1>A working base you can test now.</h1>
            <p>Add users, add customers, maintain products, and replace product prices from Excel.</p>
          </div>
          <button class="primary" onclick="showPage('price-import', document.querySelector('[data-page=price-import]'))">Upload Price Excel</button>
        </div>
        <div class="stats-grid">
          <div class="stat"><span>Users</span><strong id="statUsers">0</strong></div>
          <div class="stat"><span>Customers</span><strong id="statCustomers">0</strong></div>
          <div class="stat"><span>Products</span><strong id="statProducts">0</strong></div>
          <div class="stat"><span>Last Import</span><strong id="statImport">Never</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Recent activity</h3><p>Changes made in this browser</p></div></div>
          <div id="activityList" class="activity-list"></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="page-users" class="page">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-head">
            <div><h3>User Management</h3><p>Create admin, sales, and dealer users.</p></div>
            <button class="primary" onclick="openUserModal()">+ Add User</button>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Email</th><th>Role</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="userRows"></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="page-customers" class="page">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-head">
            <div><h3>Customers</h3><p>Keep company and contact details ready for quotations.</p></div>
            <button class="primary" onclick="openCustomerModal()">+ Add Customer</button>
          </div>
          <div class="toolbar"><input id="customerSearch" placeholder="Search company, contact, phone or email" oninput="renderCustomers()" /></div>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Company</th><th>Contact</th><th>Phone</th><th>Email</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="customerRows"></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="page-products" class="page">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-head">
            <div><h3>Products</h3><p>Maintain standalone products and package components.</p></div>
            <button class="primary" onclick="openProductModal()">+ Add Product</button>
          </div>
          <div class="toolbar two">
            <input id="productSearch" placeholder="Search model, description, brand or series" oninput="renderProducts()" />
            <select id="productCategoryFilter" onchange="renderProducts()"><option value="">All categories</option></select>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Description</th><th>Category</th><th>Brand</th><th class="num">Cost</th><th class="num">Price</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="productRows"></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="page-price-import" class="page">
        <div class="import-grid">
          <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Excel Price Import</h3><p>Update prices by matching the Model column.</p></div></div>
            <div class="dropzone" id="dropzone">
              <input id="excelFile" type="file" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" onchange="handleExcelFile(event)" />
              <div class="drop-icon">↑</div>
              <h3>Drop Excel here or click to browse</h3>
              <p>Accepted: .xlsx, .xls, .csv</p>
            </div>
            <div class="template-box">
              <strong>Required column</strong><span>Model</span>
              <strong>Price column</strong><span>Price or Selling Price</span>
              <p>Optional: Description, Cost, HP, kW, Brand, Series, Category.</p>
              <a href="Price_Import_Template.xlsx" download>Download Excel template</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Import Summary</h3><p>Nothing changes until you confirm.</p></div></div>
            <div class="summary-cards">
              <div><span>Updated</span><strong id="sumUpdated">0</strong></div>
              <div><span>New</span><strong id="sumNew">0</strong></div>
              <div><span>Skipped</span><strong id="sumSkipped">0</strong></div>
            </div>
            <button id="confirmImportBtn" class="primary full" disabled onclick="confirmImport()">Confirm Import</button>
            <button class="ghost full" onclick="clearImport()">Clear Preview</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Preview</h3><p>Existing and incoming prices are shown before saving.</p></div></div>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Status</th><th>Model</th><th>Description</th><th class="num">Old Price</th><th class="num">New Price</th><th>Change</th></tr></thead><tbody id="importRows"></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <div id="modal" class="modal hidden" onclick="modalBackdrop(event)">
    <div class="modal-card">
      <div class="modal-head"><h3 id="modalTitle"></h3><button class="icon-btn" onclick="closeModal()">×</button></div>
      <div id="modalBody"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

# KeySuite Alpha V0.1

GitHub Pages-ready working demo for Keylargo.

## Features
- Working local login
- Add/edit/delete users
- Add/edit/delete customers
- Add/edit/delete products
- Excel price import with preview and confirmation
- Existing model prices are updated; unknown models are added
- Browser local storage persistence

## Demo login
- Email: `ray@keylargo.com`
- Password: `admin123`

## Publish on GitHub Pages
1. Create a new public or private GitHub repository.
2. Upload every file in this folder to the repository root.
3. Open **Settings → Pages**.
4. Under **Build and deployment**, choose **Deploy from a branch**.
5. Select `main` and `/root`, then save.

## Important alpha limitation
This version is a front-end demo. Data is stored only in the current browser using `localStorage`. It is suitable for testing the workflow, but not yet for multi-user production use. Supabase authentication and cloud database will be connected in the next build.

## Excel import columns
Required:
- Model
- Price

Optional:
- Description
- Cost
- HP
- kW
- Brand
- Series
- Category

